OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest fans' plea over
OL,4,Astadium expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottingham Forest supporters' group
OL,7,Fhas written an open letter asking
OL,8,Fcouncillors to back expansion plans for
OL,9,Fits stadium, saying "it is the City
OL,10,FGround's time".
OL,12,FRushcliffe Borough Council's planning
OL,13,Fcommittee will meet on Wednesday to
OL,14,Fconsider applications from the club on
OL,15,Fproposed changes to the ground.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
