OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest fans' plea over
OL,4,Astadium expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn June last year, the committee
OL,7,Fgranted full planning permission to
OL,8,Fincrease its overall capacity to
OL,9,F35,000, followed in January by the club
OL,10,Fsubmitting another set of applications
OL,11,Fto take the capacity to more than
OL,12,F50,000.
OL,14,FThe Nottingham Forest Supporters' Trust
OL,15,F(NFST) urged the authority not to let
OL,16,Fconcerns over transport and supporter
OL,17,Fmovement on matchdays further delay the
OL,18,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
